he middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal for August to September and 36% for September to October. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, at 60% or 61% of normal. On grid 24462 the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 127.2, and it can still change.</p>"}
